WEBVTT

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:55.950
Gomez!

00:00:58.580 --> 00:00:59.950
Go look that way!

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:36.360
Your luck ends here, Golgo 13.

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:46.750
We're only looking for evidence now,

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:50.000
but I will prove that you're responsible for the assassination in San Francisco...

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:56.510
...and have you suffer on the electric chair.

00:01:56.510 --> 00:02:02.560
I, Leon Goldman, swear as an FBI agent.

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:13.360
It's him...

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:15.280
...from six years ago.

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:22.700
He can kill any target with just one shot.

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:27.830
We couldn't find a witness, Officer.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:29.370
Same here.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:34.420
Where did he shoot from?

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:39.630
What's wrong?

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:46.220
There's no way he could've shot from there.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:48.560
It's too far, Inspector.

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:49.230
But still...

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:50.400
Excuse me?

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:52.150
It's nothing.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:57.030
The FBI is supposed to direct the police force,

00:02:57.030 --> 00:03:01.490
but he's just an old fag who's nothing more than a figurehead.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:31.230
I held my breath and kept waiting while my heart was scratched away

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:42.570
A minute, a second never felt so long

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:54.330
I look up at the sky and ask the wind, "Can I fly now?"

00:03:54.540 --> 00:04:00.630
The weak person I was is no more

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:06.220
I decided to just believe

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:13.350
With the dreams I once had in my hand now

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:17.190
I go towards you

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:24.910
Carrying those emotions I felt when I broke

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:29.040
I go towards you

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:33.080
Blown by the wind

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:38.540
Oh blown

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:45.260
Afterglow

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:51.100
You know something about the shooter, right? Tell me the truth.

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:54.520
Say something, your boss is dead.

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:02.400
You were chasing the suspect with a pistol!

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.950
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:06.320
I wasn't chasing him, I was looking for him.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:09.580
In any case, I didn't see anyone suspicious.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:49.660
I'm back.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:50.990
Welcome back.

00:05:56.710 --> 00:06:00.880
"Chicago's biggest mafia boss, Gomez, is dead."

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:08.180
Hubby, how's the investigation going?

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:11.300
Did you find out something new?

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:16.600
Without any evidence, it's impossible to guess who did it.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:17.770
Really?

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.230
Thanks.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:22.440
Yes.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:36.450
What's wrong?

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.460
It's nothing.

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:18.200
I'll send you reinforcements immediately.

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.330
Don't take your eyes off him.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:25.880
So they came all the way from Chicago, after all.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:30.470
They did that so they could find the suspect themselves, and avenge their boss' demise.

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:34.760
If they find him first, then we'll lose our pride as the police!

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:37.060
That's right.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:39.640
Our pride isn't the only thing that we should worry about.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:45.360
The worst thing that could happen is innocent civilians getting involved in the gang's revenge.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:46.480
That's right.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:17.810
What's with you?

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.560
Are you afraid of this ball?

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.810
I just don't like anyone following me.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.730
He's pretty interesting.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:26.110
Yo, come check this guy out.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:28.360
I found a rude bastard.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:32.490
He says he'll kick my ass if I walk behind him,

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:34.820
to <i>me</i>, that is.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:37.780
Damn.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:46.000
General, Sergeant Michael has just returned from the Middle-East's guerrilla war.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:46.420
Get out of my way.

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:49.300
Fuck!

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:57.090
Then, I'll...

00:08:58.970 --> 00:08:59.890
Fuck off.

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.770
You're pretty strong, dude.

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:06.940
You see, I kicked asses back in Wisconsin State.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:09.150
I was a heavy-weight boxer.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:21.200
I thought you were a weakling and let my guard down.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.450
I'm gonna kill your fucking ass.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:31.090
Fuck.

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:32.340
That's enough.

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:39.260
He's isn't someone you can beat.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.930
FBI.

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:44.680
Now get out of here.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.600
You'll pay for this.

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:59.990
It's been a long time, Mr. Togo.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:03.790
I'm sure you haven't forgotten me.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:08.460
As always, you can pull off some amazing shots.

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:14.670
I'm talking about the sniping at the Waikiki beach.

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:22.260
I knew it was you from the moment that I got to the scene.

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:29.690
And now I meet you again, and I'm sure that it's you.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.690
It's been six years since that time.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:51.960
I was excited when you were arrested as a possible suspect for the murder of the lawyer, Mr. Graham.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:57.720
This was because I believed I could finally get the famous Golgo 13 executed on the electric chair.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:06.560
I worked hard in order to find evidence.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:07.640
But one day,

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:20.700
without notice, the guys from the Pentagon took you in to ask you about national matters.

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:24.620
After all my hard work to simply get you arrested.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:27.580
I didn't care what the government's intention was.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:34.290
As an inspector, I ran into the Pentagon in order to get you back...

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:36.000
You, who was a murder suspect!

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:40.340
But the Pentagon director told me this:

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:45.510
"The nation's affairs are more important than your personal need for justice."

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:49.480
He told me to give up on your case.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:53.600
But I didn't give up.

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:02.280
I wanted you to get executed on an electric chair.

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:06.870
With that motivation, I studied your data word by word,

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:11.580
and at the same time, complained to both the CIA and FBI.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:15.880
And all I gained from that hard work...

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:20.010
...was a demotion into an officer on a small island.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:25.760
Six years ago, I was sent here to Hawaii.

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:32.310
Six years ago, you couldn't fulfill your oath, so are you trying to finish it now?

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:36.150
Just leave this island quickly.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:42.280
You just bring trouble for me.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:47.160
Even if I find evidence and arrest you, I can't put you on trial.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:52.160
This is because the CIA and FBI classify everything about you as top secret.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.420
It's useless for me to do anything.

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:03.670
So even for this Gomez case, I've decided to pretend that I don't know anything.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:07.680
So you'll pretend you don't know it was me and just allow me to leave?

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:09.890
That's right. Right now.

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:13.480
No one in the headquarters has realized that it was you.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:37.500
Is everyone out?

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:40.710
Inspector!

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:42.550
You were right.

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:44.590
What do you mean?

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:49.550
Hearing from you bothered me, so I went to the hotel that you were gazing at.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:52.060
I found a witness.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:56.190
He claims that he saw a suspicious man before and after the incident.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:59.060
He was an Asian with a buffed up body and very sharp eyes.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.560
I see.

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:03.980
I'll try to investigate this myself in the morning.

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:07.030
We don't have much time.

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:09.490
I'll definitely find that man!

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.080
Wait a second.

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:34.850
Let's eat dinner outside tonight.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:36.350
It's our wedding anniversary, after all.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:38.230
I don't really like places with a lot of people...

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:39.520
That's right, I forgot.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.860
All right, I'll come back home as soon as possible.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:04.210
So he showed up.

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:05.880
I'll repay the debt.

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:07.760
I don't like losing all the time.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.220
What are you doing?

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:15.760
I'll be there immediately.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:18.770
It looks like he was harassed by Gomez's underlings.

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.520
By the gangs?

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:21.900
That's not good.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.900
We should arrest them before we search for the killer.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:25.730
Let's go.

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:26.780
Yes, sir!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:55.180
What are you doing?

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:59.180
I'm busy now. Don't bring in people for small fights.

00:15:58.720 --> 00:15:59.810
I'm sorry!

00:15:59.180 --> 00:15:59.810
Let them go.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:01.520
Everyone, now.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:12.200
I told you to leave Hawaii as soon as possible.

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:15.070
I don't take orders from anyone.

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:18.240
I probably didn't properly deliver the message yesterday.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:22.080
I didn't give you an order, I was asking you to leave.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:29.840
Gomez's underlings are trying to find the killer, and avenge their boss' death.

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:36.090
A few inside the office are starting to investigate you as well.

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:38.220
I'll protect myself.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.100
That's the problem.

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:47.730
Six years ago, I had a grudge against you.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:50.190
But now it's different.

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:53.740
I love Hawaii now.

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:56.620
I even thank you for having me move to Hawaii.

00:16:56.620 --> 00:17:00.830
It's such a nice place for retired people.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:04.750
Please, I beg you.

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.630
You always bring trouble with you.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:10.210
If anyone dies, my job will be in danger.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:11.630
I hope you understand.

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:18.220
I'll retire in two years,

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:20.390
and I have a young, sexy wife.

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:22.640
I don't want to get involved in a troublesome incident.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:29.270
I'm not the same person you knew six years ago.

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:33.070
I'm about to face the end of life.

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:50.170
Even you are nothing more than a distant memory from the past.

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.180
Yesterday...

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:06.390
...how did you know I was at the gym?

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:09.400
Instinct.

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:14.530
For someone like you, with your body trained to the limit,

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:17.740
you must need some exercise while traveling.

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:22.410
If you think with that mindset, it's not so hard to predict where you'll be.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:27.710
Well then, it's time for me to leave.

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:30.420
Golgo...

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:33.420
Mr. Togo.

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:42.450
What happened?

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:44.070
What about the suspicious Asian?

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.330
Nothing found for now.

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:50.080
What about the inspector?

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.620
He left work earlier.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:52.790
Just a while ago.

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:55.040
He's an excellent FBI agent.

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:57.590
That inspector, was he really that awesome in the past?

00:19:58.170 --> 00:19:59.590
That's what I heard.

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:00.590
At least in the past...

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:02.720
A long, long time ago, eh?

00:22:33.740 --> 00:22:39.000
It doesn't matter anymore

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:44.550
Who craved freedom first

00:22:45.710 --> 00:22:53.430
How we decided to part, and how we loved each other

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:55.770
As nostalgic and simply just that

00:22:55.810 --> 00:23:03.860
Once you've lost it you'll feel lonely

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:07.690
You may have to overcome the pain

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:12.950
Many times with that cruel heart of yours

00:23:13.070 --> 00:23:21.250
But you just can't become as strong as you've imagined

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:25.840
It was just a dream

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:29.220
So let us return to tomorrow

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:34.220
In this calm night

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:36.390
There'll only be wanderers

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:41.560
But now you've awakened, so walk down that path of yours

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:47.570
And even though time is fleeting

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:54.070
People sometimes desire too much

00:24:01.620 --> 00:24:05.590
A double spy hiding in an impregnable fortress.

00:24:05.590 --> 00:24:09.880
In order to snipe him, Golgo will wait however long it takes,

00:24:09.880 --> 00:24:11.840
and grab onto the truth for the victory.

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:20.310
When the mailman showed up at the castle as usual, Golgo held onto his rifle.

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:24.770
Next time, on Golgo 13: Steinbeck III.

00:24:20.930 --> 00:24:26.940
Steinbeck III

00:24:24.770 --> 00:24:26.900
If you value your life,

00:24:26.900 --> 00:24:28.650
don't stand behind him.

00:24:39.870 --> 00:24:44.830
This show is based on a true story.
